        "title": "Spellbinding.  Must see!",
        "text": "Hindu temple/cremation site - the main one in Kathmandu.  An absolute cultural must in Kathmandu/Nepal. Speak to the Hindu shamans, see the rituals involved with end of life for the Hindu faith tradition, watch the celebration of culture, life, death and reincarnation.  I was spellbound by this visit.  The rich and vastly different, at times affronting, cultural is out in the open to see and experience.  Awesome.  A must see in my opinion.",
