        "title": "Witness burning of bodies- if you can take it ",
        "text": "For those sensitive, this site might not be for you. You witness the burning of bodies by the river, literally a body is placed over wood to be burnt in their funeral ceremony. It takes several hours for the process to be complete. If you do choose to visit this section of the temple area, I advise to hire a guide for about 10$, it is well worth the money since you really get explanations about what you see, the rituals and traditions. ",
